ing as titular character Meredith Grey, who provides narration for a majority of the series' episodes.\\n\\nIn 2007, Rhimes created and produced the Grey's Anatomy spin-off series Private Practice, which debuted September 26, 2007, on ABC. The show chronicles the life of ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shonda_Rhimes\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d195\"},\"ref\":\"d195\",\"snippet\":\" ... She told EW that her decision to leave \\\"Grey's Anatomy\\\" 18 months before her contract was up stemmed from her wish to spend more time with her family, saying that adopting her daughter \\\"changed everything\\\" for her. \\\"I felt it was the right thing to do; we ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nickiswift.com/450696/tv-actors-who-said-no-to-an-episode/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d62\"},\"ref\":\"d62\",\"snippet\":\" ... The daughter of the prodigious Dr. Ellis Grey, Meredith found herself grappling with the pressure of living up to her mother's legacy. An ensemble series, Grey's Anatomy also followed other surgical interns, residents, and attendings, including Sandra Oh's Dr. Christina Yang, Meredith's best friend ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/most-influential-tv-shows-2000s/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d42\"},\"ref\":\"d42\",\"snippet\":\" ... Meredith Grey, Grey's Anatomy follows the drama and romance at Seattle Grace Mercy West Hospital, later renamed Grey Sloan Memorial Hospital. Although the show outgrew its main character in Season 19, it's still going strong with 21 seasons and counting. When it first aired, its cast ... \",\"title\":\"https://movieweb.com/most-watched-tv-shows-2000s/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d251\"},\"ref\":\"d251\",\"snippet\":\" ... All take a different approach to the delicate topic of adoption, and all can help encourage a conversation about adoption in your own home. Grab a snack and settle in, as Adoptions With Love highlights five of our favorite TV shows about adoption.\\n\\n-\\n\\nGrey's Anatomy\\n\\nABC's ... \",\"title\":\"https://adoptionswithlove.org/uncategorized/adoption-on-television\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"4c02428b4edc4d962273688a7cb43b2c372ae6ff2076d681623ab8ac0c2a6086\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"664609d0cfc153a4267cf9e17959f58aef6579dfca63bf513fb669d195adfb9b\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Grey's Anatomy cast real life mother daughter different characters\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d51\"},\"ref\":\"d51\",\"snippet\":\" ... Crossovers Between Grey's Anatomy and Private Practice:\\n\\n|\\n\\nShow |\\n\\nEpisode Number |\\n\\nEpisode Title |\\n\\n|\\n\\nGrey's Anatomy |\\n\\n3x23 & 3x24 |\\n\\n\\\"The Other Side of This Life\\\" |\\n\\n|\\n\\nPrivate Practice |\\n\\n1x01 |\\n\\n\\\"In Which We Meet Addison, a Nice Girl From Somewhere Else\\\" |\\n\\n|\\n\\nGrey's Anatomy |\\n\\n4x13 |\\n\\n\\\"Piece of My Heart\\\" |\\n\\n|\\n\\nGrey's ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/greys-anatomy-spinoff-shows-timeline-connections-explained/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d62\"},\"ref\":\"d62\",\"snippet