tors and nurses who love Max's \\\"The Pitt\\\" remember ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/02/19/arts/television/pitt-doctors-noah-wyle.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d243\"},\"ref\":\"d243\",\"snippet\":\" ... Ellen Pompeo\\n\\nBefore spending 20-plus seasons playing Dr. Meredith Grey on Grey's Anatomy, Ellen Pompeo's first credited small-screen role was in a 1996 episode of Law & Order, playing Jenna Weber. She returned in 2000 as Laura Kendrick.\\n\\nPeter Facinelli\\n\\nThe Twilight Saga's Peter ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/law-and-order-famous-guest-stars-11693330?srsltid=AfmBOoq7LSQDeUszJ75bu5I9E6Xu6pQw13zob5kfrqfyixiNErsKwy9w\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d256\"},\"ref\":\"d256\",\"snippet\":\" ... Its unique beauty has placed the grey crowned crane on the flag of Uganda, and it is the country's national bird. Sadly, the grey crowned crane is classed by the IUCN as endangered due to human activity and habitat degradation.\\n\\nAardvarks\\n\\nThe aardvark is a burrowing, nocturnal ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.ifaw.org/international/journal/most-fascinating-animals-africa\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d252\"},\"ref\":\"d252\",\"snippet\":\" ... Although this effect may have some benefits, the majority of the consequences are negative because of the unrealistic portrayal of treatment prognosis, hospital dynamics, and exceptionally high expectations of the roles of doctors.\\n\\nTo show the extent of the differences between Grey's Anatomy healthcare versus real-life ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.dukemedicalethicsjournal.com/copy-of-mychart-expanding-accessibil-1\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"eb16c37f184207444db98ad2105e1caf312cfc6eb6d7ad08988c19e587706a9a\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"dfe456036b98d14a0014475e8fda50b8d81261934739fc6aeb1ad61fd0216d15\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Grey's Anatomy real life relatives play unrelated roles\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_961c48a938e74908ba03c80c"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d196\"},\"ref\":\"d196\",\"snippet\":\" ... Cristina Yang from Grey's Anatomy\\n\\n4. Buffy Summers from Buffy the Vampire Slayer\\n\\n5. Olivia Pope from Scandal\\n\\n6. Rosa Diaz from Brooklyn Nine-Nine\\n\\n7. Callie Torres from Grey's Anatomy\\n\\n8. Kate Pearson from This Is Us\\n\\n9. Jane Villanueva from Jane the Virgin\\n\\n10 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.buzzfeed.com/noradominick/female-tv-characters-that-inspire-us\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d188\"},\"ref\":\"d188\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2005, they won a Tony Award for their role in Spamalot, and joined Grey's shortly after.\\n\\nNow: Ramírez left Grey's after season 12, having played Dr. Callie Torres for a whopping 239 episodes. In addition to voicing Queen Miranda on the Disney animated series Sofia ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/gallery/greys-anatomy-cast-before-they-were-stars/?srsltid=AfmBOop9veMvemNQBxOptWObS-iC49SGiFhqZjNBzk87cYVuzqnbjT2L\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\