nel's Wish Upon a Star and Bride of Chucky. In 1999, she appeared as a lead in the WB ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/suits-cast-characters\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d258\"},\"ref\":\"d258\",\"snippet\":\" ... DO vs MD - Osteopathic vs Allopathic - What's the Difference?\\nauthor: Callie Torres November\\ndate: 2020-11-15\\n---\\nWhen visiting the doctor, chances are you didn't check what type of doctor they are – DO vs MD? Perhaps you didn't even realize that there were two different ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.umhs-sk.org/blog/do-vs-md\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d197\"},\"ref\":\"d197\",\"snippet\":\" ... Regardless of Tom's somewhat ambiguous counsel, Julie and Kevin's relationship progressed successfully, culminating in a strong marriage.\\n\\nJeremy Shelley\\n\\n(Social Networks)\\n\\nBlair McElroy, sister of former New York Jets quarterback Greg McElroy, was romantically involved with former Atlanta Falcons placekicker Jeremy Shelley. Despite any challenges they ... \",\"title\":\"https://bolavip.com/en/sports/pro-athletes-who-dated-siblings-of-other-pro-athletes-or-coaches-daughters-2\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"1471b8ce3cf5f89f89d6f4879fb26ef1f92718799943ea0270cc35aae7f24aa5\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"390cfee9a868b1bd8624d16cae5db37bb5c6bf78509750988cadd365986f6ee5\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Callie Torres marriages Grey's Anatomy\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ran