f9e2c045143d3a31be16cde325a1\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"454261686e4f88b09b1e2c9e495dc3435d01db0f06075bf3fe68610b1435592a\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Cristina Yang marriages Owen Hunt Grey's Anatomy\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_70a4ce9102b54c6681e66e4f"},{"content":"Let me reconsider the clues. The \"real-life relative plays unrelated character\" is the most distinctive. Let me think about \"The Fosters\" (2013-2018, 5 seasons) — Teri Polo. Or \"Pretty Little Liars.\" Actually, let me reconsider \"Jane the Virgin\" — the narrator is the adult Jane's son... no.\n\nLet me reconsider the \"real-life relative\" angle. A famous case: in \"The Vampire Diaries,\" there's no real-life relative. But in \"Pretty Little Liars,\" there's no. Let me think about \"Once Upon a Time\" — Jennifer Morrison. No.\n\nActually, the most famous \"real-life relative plays unrelated character\" is in \"The Fosters\" — Teri Polo and... no. Let me reconsider \"Shameless\" (2011-2021, 11 seasons). Emmy Rossum. No real-life relative.\n\nLet me reconsider the height clue (1.65-1.70m) and \"married 3-4 times, one child survives.\" This sounds like a soap opera character. Let me think about \"The Bold and the Beautiful\" or \"Days of Our Lives.\" But those started before 2000.\n\nLet me reconsider — \"first appeared in a season that started before 2020 but after 2000.\" This means the actor's first appearance was in a season that started between 2001-2019. Let me think about \"Grey's Anatomy\" (2005, 19+ seasons). A character married 3-4 times with one surviving child... Let me search for the real-life relative angle in Grey's Anatomy specifically.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Grey's Anatomy actress real life daughter plays character unrelated\", \"Grey's Anatomy cast real life mother daughter different characters\", \"Grey's Anatomy real life relatives play unrelated roles\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_bc49469ba20d4625a03afa8b","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Callie Torres marriages Grey's Anatomy\", \"Arizona Robbins marriages Grey's Anatomy\", \"Cristina Yang marriages Owen Hunt Grey's Anatomy\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_c66db6d4965c4372bd28ff70","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":true,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d51\"},\"ref\":\"d51\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/greys-anatomy-spinoff-shows-timeline-connections-explained/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d62\"},\"ref\":\"d62\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/most-influential-tv-shows-2000s/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d49\"},\"ref\":\"d49\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shonda_Rhimes\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d243\"},\"ref\":\"d243\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/law-and-order-famous-guest-stars-11693330?srsltid=AfmBOoq7LSQDeUszJ75bu5I9E6Xu6pQw13zob5kfrqfyixiNErsKwy9w\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d100\"},\"ref\":\"d100\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_date=1990-01-01,1990-12-31&gender=female\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"r